[88.546489, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m"]
[88.546753, "o", "\r\n╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n║  Demo Complete — All Tests Passed                           ║\r\n║                                                              ║\r\n║  1. Free-tier (3 RPM)    → 3 requests OK, 4th → 429        ║\r\n║  2. 429 includes headers → Retry-After, X-RateLimit-*       ║\r\n║  3. Premium (10 RPM)     → 5 requests all OK                ║"]
[88.546898, "o", "\r\n║  4. Per-user isolation   → User A blocked, User B OK        ║\r\n║  5. No group match       → Unlimited (5 requests OK)        ║\r\n║                                                              ║\r\n║  In-process local limiter. No Redis. No external service.    ║\r\n║  Inspired by Envoy AI Gateway usage-based rate limiting.     ║"]
[88.546965, "o", "\r\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝"]
